      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: ₹4.51 loss per share (down from ₹14.02 profit in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹8.03b (down 53% from FY 2025). Net loss: ₹386.7m (down 136% from profit in FY 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 61%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 49% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 22% growth forecast for the Real Estate industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 28% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 9% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
